CharacterizationRule.Notes:
Catch-all passthrough rule to keep propagating taint to tags we don't have rules for (bug 26614).

<c:set var="taint" value='<%= request.getParameter("a") %>'/>
We report this: ${taint}
<custom:passthrough>
  We do not report this: ${taint}
</custom:passthrough>

